// Appeal Server example.
// Run Net_Config before this script so all service ports are configured.
//
// Connections accepted on the Appeal port use the Appeal service mode.
// Run and Download requests are transported by the current plugin.
// Net_Data_Source execution and file transfer will be added later.
// Run only one of the included server examples at a time.

Network Server

Print "Generic Network Server started"
Print "Appeal connections are accepted on the configured Appeal port"
Print "Use Network Stop_Server to stop the server"

Return
